{"text": " You wake up in 1993 in Tokushima, on Japan's island of Shikoku. Inside a small company lab, an engineer is staring at a chip. Did you know that the missing color of light was blue? Red and green glowing chips had been around for decades. Without blue, you couldn't make white. Here's your morning. The engineer, Shuji Nakamura, has made a bright blue light from a crystal, add a yellow coating and you get white light from a chip. No fire, no glowing wire. Very little heat. 21 years later, he and two Japanese scientists share the Nobel Prize for it. What does one hour of light cost you now? In 1992, with an energy saving bulb, less than half a second of work. So what is light now? A crystal, light without fire. So when light costs almost nothing, what do we do with it?", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.44, "text": " You wake up in 1993 in Tokushima,", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 25137, 294, 11036, 49754, 11, 50516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1384356549677958, "compression_ratio": 1.5670103092783505, "no_speech_prob": 0.028674472123384476, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.7430940270423889}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.28, "probability": 0.9670720100402832}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.46, "probability": 0.9992479681968689}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.56, "probability": 0.9948692321777344}, {"word": " 1993", "start": 0.56, "end": 1.24, "probability": 0.9929433465003967}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.92, "probability": 0.84590083360672}, {"word": " Tokushima,", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.44, "probability": 0.7875580787658691}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.08, "end": 4.54, "text": " on Japan's island of Shikoku.", "tokens": [50516, 322, 3367, 311, 6077, 295, 1160, 1035, 13275, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1384356549677958, "compression_ratio": 1.5670103092783505, "no_speech_prob": 0.028674472123384476, "wor